            0.253,
            0.79,
            0.857,
            0.823
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. A toy car of mass 100 g is moving with a constant velocity of 0.5 m s"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "–1",
              "styles": [
                "superscript"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ". What is the net force acting on the toy car?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.254,
            0.825,
            0.859,
            0.873
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. Two children of different masses are sitting on identical swings. To impart identical initial acceleration, for which child would you require to apply a larger force? Explain why."
